{"id":213076,"bangumiId":213076,"type":2,"name":"妹さえいればいい。","name_cn":"如果有妹妹就好了。","date":"2017-10-08","year":"2017","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/d0/59/213076_J5y9R.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/d0/59/213076_J5y9R.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/d0/59/213076_J5y9R.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/d0/59/213076_J5y9R.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/d0/59/213076_J5y9R.jpg"},"summary":"「如果有妹妹的话就能拥有最棒的人生了，为什么我却没有妹妹呢……？」\r\n专写妹系作品的妹控小说家羽岛伊月，身边聚集着各式各样不同个性的人物。有天才变态作家可儿那由多、女大学生白川京、插画家屁桃，以及鬼畜税务师大野艾希莉等等。\r\n伊月等人虽然各自有着不同的烦恼，但还是一边写着小说，玩着电玩，喝着酒，申报所得税，过着喧闹的日常生活。\r\n在一旁温暖守护着伊月等人的，是伊月的继弟千寻。然而，千寻竟藏着一个天大的秘密……\r\n欢乐又锥心，由天才、凡人与怪咖所展开的多重路线青春恋爱喜剧，现在开演！","rating":{"rank":4360,"total":7265,"count":{"1":25,"2":25,"3":47,"4":157,"5":531,"6":2104,"7":3088,"8":1032,"9":153,"10":103},"score":6.7},"collection":{"on_hold":607,"dropped":547,"wish":2107,"collect":12860,"doing":768},"tags":[{"name":"轻小说改","count":1582,"total_count":509241},{"name":"恋爱","count":1225,"total_count":582694},{"name":"妹控","count":1217,"total_count":18702},{"name":"2017年10月","count":1175,"total_count":22895},{"name":"SILVERLINK.","count":920,"total_count":36675},{"name":"日常","count":853,"total_count":414872},{"name":"TV","count":773,"total_count":1443488},{"name":"大沼心","count":671,"total_count":16319},{"name":"搞笑","count":530,"total_count":656819},{"name":"平坂読","count":478,"total_count":926},{"name":"轻改","count":468,"total_count":155651},{"name":"2017","count":458,"total_count":72587},{"name":"如果有妹妹就好了","count":343,"total_count":349},{"name":"后宫","count":184,"total_count":311229},{"name":"小说改","count":147,"total_count":167491},{"name":"日本","count":98,"total_count":313472}],"eps":12,"total_episodes":12,"aliases":["如果有妹妹就好了。","妹さえいればいい。","A Sister's All You Need","Imouto Sae Ireba ii","如果能写小说就好了"],"sourceType":"bibliography","nsfw":false,"annualRank":32,"sourceYear":2017,"sourceUrl":"https://bgm.